<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">

                        <h2 class="title">Why Choose UK for Study?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>

                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Get Education at Prestigious Universities 
                            <p class="fs-5">The UK is home to world’s top-ranked universities for their academic excellence, detailed programs, and vast research opportunities.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            High Quality of Teaching and Standards 
                            <p class="fs-5">The teaching standards are monitored by organizations like the Quality Assurance Agency (QAA), so students receive the best possible education.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Shorter Course Durations 
                            <p class="fs-5">Most undergraduate degrees in the UK can be completed in three years, and many postgraduate programs take just one year.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Diverse and Multicultural Environment 
                            <p class="fs-5">The UK is a melting pot of cultures, with about 14% of its population coming from abroad. Students benefit from exposure to a wide array of cultures.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Flexible and Wide Range of Courses 
                            <p class="fs-5">UK universities offer a vast selection of courses and specializations across all disciplines, giving students the flexibility to tailor their studies to their interests and career goals.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Work Opportunities During and After Study 
                            <p class="fs-5">International students are allowed to work 20 hours per week part-time during their studies. Also, eligible for a 2 year post-study work visa to gain international experience.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Scholarships and Financial Support 
                            <p class="fs-5">Many UK universities offer scholarships and financial aid specifically for international students, making higher education more accessible.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Rich Cultural and Historical Experience 
                            <p class="fs-5"> Beyond academics, students in the UK can experience a country with a rich history, vibrant arts scene, and easy access to the rest of Europe for travel and exploration.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Strong Support for International Students 
                            <p class="fs-5"> UK universities provide robust support services, including help with visas, accommodation, and adapting to life in a new country, to ensure a smooth transition for international students.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <img src="~/assets/images/banner/london-eye.jpg" style="border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 10px #3a397d54;" alt="Study Abroad United Kingdom" title="Study Abroad United Kingdom" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>



